---
/**
 * English privacy policy page.
 *
 * Turkish page: /gizlilik-politikasi (KVKK aydınlatma metni). Bu sayfa
 * aynı veri akışlarını uluslararası okuyucuya İngilizce anlatır; hukuki
 * dayanak (6698 sayılı Kanun / KVKK) olduğu gibi korunur çünkü veri
 * sorumluluğu Türk mevzuatına tabidir.
 *
 * Veri akışı değiştiğinde HER İKİ sayfa da güncellenmelidir.
 */
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../../lib/site-config";

/** Metnin son güncellenme tarihi — içerik değiştikçe elle güncelleyin. */
const lastUpdated = new Date("2026-07-20");
const lastUpdatedLabel = lastUpdated.toLocaleDateString("en-US", {
  year: "numeric",
  month: "long",
  day: "numeric",
});
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy & Data Processing Notice"
  description={`How ${siteConfig.name} collects, stores and processes your personal data, and your rights under the Turkish Data Protection Law (KVKK).`}
  altHref="/gizlilik-politikasi"
>
  <section class="section-shell">
    <div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10">
      <div
        class="aurora left-1/2 top-[-12%] h-[420px] w-[700px] -translate-x-1/2 bg-primary-600/18"
      >
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-body mx-auto max-w-3xl px-24 py-64 lg:px-32 lg:py-96">
      <h1
        class="font-display text-[clamp(1.875rem,1.1rem+3.2vw,3rem)] font-semibold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.02em] text-balance text-neutral-50"
      >
        Privacy Policy & Data Processing Notice
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-24 text-sm text-neutral-500">
        Last updated: {lastUpdatedLabel}
      </p>

      <div aria-hidden="true" class="hairline mt-48 opacity-60"></div>

      <div
        class="prose prose-cnkr mt-48 max-w-none prose-headings:font-display prose-a:no-underline hover:prose-a:underline prose-a:underline-offset-4"
      >
        <p>
          This notice explains, in accordance with the Turkish Personal Data
          Protection Law No. 6698 ("KVKK"), for what purposes personal data
          collected through the {siteConfig.name} ({siteConfig.domain})
          website is processed, with whom it is shared, and what your rights
          are.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Data Controller</h2>
        <p>
          Your personal data is processed by {siteConfig.name} as the data
          controller, within the scope described below.
        </p>
        <ul>
          {siteConfig.contactEmail && (
            <li>
              Email:{" "}
              <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contactEmail}`}>
                {siteConfig.contactEmail}
              </a>
            </li>
          )}
          {siteConfig.contactPhone && <li>Phone: {siteConfig.contactPhone}</li>}
          <li>Website: {siteConfig.domain}</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. Personal Data We Process</h2>
        <p>
          Only the data you share with us directly is collected on this site.
          There is no membership system, payment infrastructure or profile
          creation feature.
        </p>
        <h3>a) Contact form</h3>
        <p>
          When you fill out the <a href="/en/contact">form on the contact
          page</a>, the following data is processed: full name, email
          address, phone number (optional), business name (optional) and the
          content you write in the message field.
        </p>
        <h3>b) Appointment (strategy call) request</h3>
        <p>
          The embedded booking calendar on this site runs on Google
          Calendar. When you pick a time, your name and email are collected
          directly by Google and forwarded to us as an appointment record.
          Google's own privacy policy also applies at this step.
        </p>
        <h3>c) Technical records</h3>
        <p>
          When you visit the site, standard server records such as IP
          address, browser information and access time are automatically
          kept by the hosting infrastructure for security and error
          tracking.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Purposes and Legal Grounds of Processing</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Responding to your request and making an offer</strong> —
            the <em>explicit consent</em> you give when submitting the form
            (KVKK Art. 5/1) and direct relation to the establishment of a
            contract (Art. 5/2-c).
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Scheduling appointments and conducting the call</strong> —
            the explicit consent you give together with your appointment
            request.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Ensuring site security and fixing errors</strong> — the
            data controller's legitimate interest (Art. 5/2-f).
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Your personal data is never added to marketing lists without your
          permission and is not sold to third parties.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Transfers and Transfers Abroad</h2>
        <p>
          Your data is processed through the following infrastructure
          providers so the service can technically operate. As these
          providers' servers are located abroad, your form and appointment
          data are deemed transferred abroad under KVKK Art. 9; you consent
          to this transfer with the approval you give when submitting the
          form.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Netlify</strong> — hosting the site and storing contact
            form submissions.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Google (Google Calendar)</strong> — running the booking
            calendar.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Apart from this, your personal data may be shared with authorized
          public authorities only where a legal obligation arises.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Retention Period</h2>
        <p>
          Your contact and appointment requests are retained for as long as
          necessary to evaluate your request and run a potential working
          relationship; after this purpose ceases to exist, they are
          retained for at most 2 further years. At the end of this period
          the data is deleted or anonymized. If you request it, it is
          deleted even before this period ends.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          This site <strong>does not use</strong> advertising or tracking
          cookies, pixels or third-party analytics tools. Only the embedded
          Google Calendar booking calendar may place Google-owned cookies
          for its own operation. You can block cookies in your browser
          settings; in that case only the embedded calendar may stop working
          properly — the rest of the site is unaffected.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Your Rights under KVKK Art. 11</h2>
        <p>Regarding your personal data, you have the following rights:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>To learn whether your personal data is being processed,</li>
          <li>To request information if it has been processed,</li>
          <li>
            To learn the purpose of processing and whether it is used
            consistently with that purpose,
          </li>
          <li>
            To know the third parties to whom it is transferred, domestically
            or abroad,
          </li>
          <li>To request correction if it is incomplete or inaccurately processed,</li>
          <li>
            To request its erasure or destruction within the conditions set
            out in the law,
          </li>
          <li>
            To request that correction, erasure and destruction operations be
            notified to the third parties to whom the data was transferred,
          </li>
          <li>
            To object to any adverse result arising from analysis carried out
            exclusively by automated systems,
          </li>
          <li>
            To claim compensation for damages if you suffer loss due to
            unlawful processing.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          To exercise these rights, you can write to
          {siteConfig.contactEmail && (
            <>
              {" "}
              <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contactEmail}`}>
                {siteConfig.contactEmail}
              </a>{" "}
            </>
          )}
          . Your request is resolved free of charge within 30 days at the
          latest from the date it reaches us.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Changes</h2>
        <p>
          This notice is updated as the data flows on the site change (for
          example, if an analytics tool is added). The current version is
          always published on this page, together with the "last updated"
          date above.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
